{
  "info": {
    "name": "Edesur Argentina API — Integration Test Suite",
    "description": "Colección unificada para probar el flujo de la integración Home Assistant sin interfaz. No exportar valores locales ni tokens. Autenticación Google/social observada; otros métodos pendientes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{bearer_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://ed.edesur.com.ar/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "social_email",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "social_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "origin_channel",
      "value": "Wbns-RgKfqY~",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "bearer_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "account_ids",
      "value": "[]",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "meter_number",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "supply_number",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 — Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 · Google social — Obtener token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Origin",
                "value": "https://ov.edesur.com.ar"
              },
              {
                "key": "Referer",
                "value": "https://ov.edesur.com.ar/"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-origin-channel",
                "value": "{{origin_channel}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/Usuario/login-social-media",
            "description": "Usar únicamente credenciales de la cuenta propia. social_id debe obtenerse legítimamente del flujo social; este POST no implementa OAuth.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"socialMediaEmail\": \"{{social_email}}\",\n  \"socialMediaId\": \"{{social_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200,299));",
                  "let data = {}; try { data = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
                  "if (pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300 && typeof data.token === 'string' && data.token.trim()) { pm.collectionVariables.set('bearer_token',data.token.trim()); } else { pm.collectionVariables.unset('bearer_token'); }",
                  "pm.test('Token recibido',()=>pm.expect(data.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 — Contratos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "02 · Descubrir contratos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/Cliente/supply-retrieve/{{social_email}}",
            "description": "Almacena la lista de cuentas y selecciona la primera para pruebas manuales. Para verificar las demás, cambiar client_id."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200,299));",
                  "const data=pm.response.json();",
                  "const ids=Array.isArray(data.supplies)?data.supplies.map(x=>String(x.contractAccount||'')).filter(Boolean):[];",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('account_ids',JSON.stringify(ids));",
                  "if(ids.length){pm.collectionVariables.set('client_id',ids[0]);}else{pm.collectionVariables.unset('client_id');}",
                  "pm.test('Al menos un contrato',()=>pm.expect(ids.length).to.be.above(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "03 · Detalle de contrato",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/Cliente/get-client/{{client_id}}",
            "description": "No confundir contractAccount, meterNumber y nroSuministro."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200,299));",
                  "const data=pm.response.json();",
                  "if(data.meterNumber) pm.collectionVariables.set('meter_number',String(data.meterNumber));",
                  "pm.test('Identificador de contrato',()=>pm.expect(data.contractAccount).to.exist);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 — Historial y estado",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "04 · Lecturas históricas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/Cliente/get-historical-readings/{{client_id}}",
            "description": "Validar estructura real de respuesta antes de mapear sensores."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200,299));",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta JSON',()=>pm.expect(()=>pm.response.json()).not.to.throw());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "05 · Facturas históricas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/Cliente/get-historical-invoices/{{client_id}}",
            "description": "Validar estructura real de respuesta antes de mapear sensores."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200,299));",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta JSON',()=>pm.expect(()=>pm.response.json()).not.to.throw());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "06 · Pagos históricos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/Cliente/get-historical-payments/{{client_id}}",
            "description": "Validar estructura real de respuesta antes de mapear sensores."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200,299));",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta JSON',()=>pm.expect(()=>pm.response.json()).not.to.throw());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "07 · Estado del suministro",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/Cliente/get-cut-supply/{{client_id}}",
            "description": "Validar semántica real del estado."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200,299));",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta JSON',()=>pm.expect(()=>pm.response.json()).not.to.throw());"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "10 · Trámites",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/Cliente/get-formalities/{{client_id}}",
            "description": "Historial de trámites, estado y número de caso."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx',()=>pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200,299));",
                  "pm.test('Lista de trámites',()=>pm.expect(pm.response.json().formalities).to.be.an('array'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "11 · Convenios y planes de pago",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-origin-channel",
                "value": "{{origin_channel}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/PlanPagos/retrieve-agreement/{{client_id}}",
            "description": "Devuelve agreements[] históricos y current (convenio actual). No asumir que currentDebt equivale a deuda vencida. No almacenar URLs de descarga ni códigos de barras en el repositorio."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx',()=>pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200,299));",
                  "const data=pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Convenios históricos',()=>pm.expect(data.agreements).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "pm.test('Campo current',()=>pm.expect(data).to.have.property('current'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 — Deuda",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "08 · Estado de deuda (validado sin deuda)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-origin-channel",
                "value": "{{origin_channel}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/PlanPagos/get-debts?contractAccount={{client_id}}&serchType=1&value={{client_id}}",
            "description": "Si message indica no posee deuda y debts es null, se interpreta sin deuda. Formato de deudas positivas pendiente de validar."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx',()=>pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200,299));",
                  "const data=pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta de deuda',()=>pm.expect(data).to.have.property('debts'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "09 · Deuda anterior (experimental, legado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-origin-channel",
                "value": "{{origin_channel}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/PlanPagos/GetDeudaAsync",
            "description": "Método POST inferido, no confirmado. Requiere supply_number (no asumir que equivale a client_id).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nroSuministro\": \"{{supply_number}}\",\n  \"tipoBusqueda\": \"nro_suministro\",\n  \"valorBusqueda\": \"{{supply_number}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 2xx', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200,299));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
